="x-default">© David Osipov. All rights reserved.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:rights><dc:description><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Horizontal logo combining the reviewed raster mascot bust with the NevroTick wordmark and the tagline System essentials, under control. On a dark slate background. Composition contains AI-generated artwork and was prepared in an AI-assisted design workflow; author: David Osipov. Derived from the reviewed NevroTick raster kit v1.1. Proprietary NevroTick brand artwork; the application source code is licensed separately as open source.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:description><Iptc4xmpCore:IntellectualGenre>Logo</Iptc4xmpCore:IntellectualGenre><Iptc4xmpCore:CreatorContactInfo rdf:parseType="Resource"><Iptc4xmpCore:CiAdrCtry>Georgia</Iptc4xmpCore:CiAdrCtry><Iptc4xmpCore:CiAdrCity>Tbilisi</Iptc4xmpCore:CiAdrCity><Iptc4xmpCore:CiEmailWork>business@david-osipov.vision</Iptc4xmpCore:CiEmailWork><Iptc4xmpCore:CiUrlWork>https://david-osipov.vision</Iptc4xmpCore:CiUrlWork></Iptc4xmpCore:CreatorContactInfo><Iptc4xmpCore:AltTextAccessibility><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The anxious mascot comparing two watches beside NevroTick and the tagline System essentials, under control. On a dark slate background.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></Iptc4xmpCore:AltTextAccessibility><xmpMM:InstanceID>xmp.iid:5e37b537-a7be-4a78-8139-c5844ac93888</xmpMM:InstanceID><xmpMM:DocumentID>xmp.did:9279a4ec-87c6-4550-b4d6-88c4abae5022</xmpMM:DocumentID><xmpMM:History><rdf:Seq><rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource"><stEvt:action>saved</stEvt:action><stEvt:instanceID>xmp.iid:5e37b537-a7be-4a78-8139-c5844ac93888</stEvt:instanceID><stEvt:when>2026-10-28T19:54:53+00:00</stEvt:when><stEvt:softwareAgent>NevroTick AVIF metadata workflow</stEvt:softwareAgent></rdf:li></rdf:Seq></xmpMM:History><xmpRights:Marked>True</xmpRights:Marked><xmpRights:Owner><rdf:Bag><rdf:li>David Osipov</rdf:li></rdf:Bag></xmpRights:Owner><xmpRights:UsageTerms><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Proprietary NevroTick b